@startuml use_case
title Smart Customer Service & Knowledge Base System - Use Case Diagram
' Naudojimo atvejų diagrama: rodo aktorius ir pagrindines sistemos funkcijas.

left to right direction

actor "Customer" as customer
actor "Support Agent" as agent
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Customer Service &\nKnowledge Base System" as system {
  usecase "Ask a question\nvia chat" as UC1
  usecase "Receive AI-generated\nanswer" as UC2
  usecase "Escalate to human agent" as UC3
  usecase "Handle escalated\nticket" as UC4
  usecase "Manage knowledge base\n(CRUD documents)" as UC5
  usecase "Review conversation\nhistory & analytics" as UC6
  usecase "Classify intent" as UC7
  usecase "Retrieve knowledge\nbase documents (RAG)" as UC8
  usecase "Generate answer\nvia Gemini API" as UC9
}

customer --> UC1
customer --> UC2
agent --> UC4
agent --> UC6
admin --> UC5

UC1 ..> UC7 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC8 : <<include>>
UC8 ..> UC9 : <<include>>
UC9 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>
UC1 ..> UC3 : <<extend>>\n(when AI cannot answer)
@enduml
